---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — REBELVAULT"
  description="Privacy Policy for REBELVAULT."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        REBELVAULT
      </div>

      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="legal-intro">
        This Privacy Policy explains how REBELVAULT handles information
        when you visit and use this website.
      </p>

      <div class="legal-meta">
        Last updated: September 2026
      </div>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. About REBELVAULT</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT is a movie discovery and directory website focused on
          films from outside the mainstream. The website provides movie
          information, categories, descriptions, images and links to
          third-party video content.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT does not ask ordinary visitors to create an account
          in order to browse the public movie catalogue.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. Information That May Be Collected</h2>

        <p>
          When you visit a website, technical information may be processed
          automatically by the website infrastructure, hosting provider,
          security systems, advertising services or other third-party
          services used by the website.
        </p>

        <p>
          This information may include an IP address, browser type,
          operating system, referring page, approximate location,
          requested pages, device information and technical logs.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT does not intentionally request sensitive personal
          information from ordinary visitors.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT or third-party services used by the website may use
          cookies or similar technologies for essential functionality,
          security, preferences, advertising, analytics or measurement.
        </p>

        <p>
          Some cookies may be placed by third-party services when their
          content or functionality is loaded on the website.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can control cookies through your browser settings. Blocking
          certain cookies may affect some website functionality.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may display or link to services operated by third
          parties. These services operate under their own privacy policies
          and terms.
        </p>

        <p>
          When you interact with an embedded video player, advertisement,
          external link or other third-party service, information may be
          processed by that third party according to its own policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Embedded Video</h2>

        <p>
          Some movie pages may display videos through third-party embedded
          video players. REBELVAULT does not control the privacy practices,
          cookies, tracking technologies or data processing of the provider
          operating such a player.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you interact with a third-party player, you should review the
          privacy policy and terms of the relevant provider.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Advertising</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may use third-party advertising services. Advertising
          providers may use cookies, device information or similar
          technologies to deliver, measure or personalize advertising,
          subject to their own policies and applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. Data Security</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT takes reasonable technical measures to protect the
          website and its systems. However, no internet transmission or
          electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely
          secure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT is not intentionally designed to collect personal
          information from children. If you believe that a child has
          provided personal information to the website, the appropriate
          contact channel should be used so the matter can be reviewed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time to reflect
          changes to the website, services or applicable requirements.
          The updated version will be published on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>

        <p>
          For privacy-related questions or requests, use the contact
          method made available by REBELVAULT.
        </p>
      </section>

      <a href="/" class="legal-back">
        ← BACK TO REBELVAULT
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .legal-page {
      padding: 90px 24px 110px;
    }

    .legal-inner {
      width: min(850px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .legal-inner h1 {
      margin: 14px 0 24px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .legal-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #b4bac3;
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-meta {
      margin-top: 18px;
      color: #666c75;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .legal-section {
      margin-top: 52px;
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .legal-section p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #9da3ad;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .legal-back {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 52px;
      color: #ff4938;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 1.2px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .legal-back:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
